// SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
//
// CLIO 3.0 intel-analysis — Ingestion (scaffolding, epic #1908 §6, issue #1934).
//
// IngestionService accepts messages/import jobs from external channels
// (Signal / WhatsApp / Telegram / SMS / Email) for downstream entity
// extraction + graph building. This is a SKELETON contract — it pins the
// import-job record + the StartImport/GetImportJob surface. Handler bodies
